  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em>魅影輪廓</em></span></strong></h1><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_68d43f3d-1139-4e01-bb0b-07d8678d8723.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"249\"></em></span></strong></p><hr><pre>這款恐怖模組新增了約17種潛伏追蹤的實體，每個都有獨特的行為模式（自訂AI）；部分具有攻擊性且能致命，但它們全數皆罕見出現。建議您切勿忽略各種可疑聲響，例如轟鳴聲、詭異的音樂或呼吸聲，因為這代表其中一個實體已悄然盯上您的靈魂。</pre><hr><h2><em><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 需安裝 GeckoLib</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">！</span></em></h2>",
